# <type>[optional scope]: <description>
#
# TYPES: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, chore, ci, build
#
# Examples:
#   feat(core): add authentication service
#   fix(shared): correct icon selector styling
#   docs(readme): add setup instructions
#   style(theme): adjust color palette
#   refactor(demo): simplify component logic
#   perf(table): optimize rendering performance
#   test(list-of-values): add unit tests for grouping
#   chore(deps): update Angular to v21
#   ci(workflows): add GitHub Actions for e2e tests
#   build(build): update bundler configuration
#
# Scopes (optional): core, shared, demo, art-institute, list-of-values, nav
#
# <SUBJECT>
# - Use imperative mood ("add feature" not "added feature")
# - Don't capitalize first letter
# - No period at the end
# - Maximum 100 characters
#
# <BODY (optional)>
# Explain what and why, not how (how is in code).
# Wrap at 100 characters.
#
# <FOOTER (optional)>
# Mention breaking changes:
# BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
